  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency life-saving Health, Nutrition, WASH and Protection support forvulnerable populations in South Central Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency life-saving Health, Nutrition, Protection, and WASH support for vulnerable populations in South and Central Somalia. The program will deliver integrated health, nutrition, protection, and WASH interventions using integrated outreach mobile teams and community health workers in the Bay Region (Baidoa and Burhakaba districts); Bakool Regions (Wajid and Hudur districts); Gedo Region (Bardheere, Luuq, and Garbahaarey districts); Banadir Region (Deynile and Kahda districts); Lower Juba Region (Afmadow and Jamaame districts); and Mudug Region (Galkacyo district).</narrative>
  </description>
